{
  "workflow_id": "general_multi_agent",
  "name": "通用多智能体协作",
  "description": "根据任务类型选择代码、检索和项目分析专家，并汇总已执行分支的结果。",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start_node",
      "type": "START",
      "position": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": 300
      },
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "out_query"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node_dispatcher",
      "type": "AGENT",
      "name": "任务拆解与路由中枢",
      "model_name": "deepseek-chat",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "system_prompt": "你是任务拆解与路由中枢。先判断用户请求需要哪些能力，再把最小可执行任务投递到对应端口。\n\n端口选择规则：\n- 【code_task】：仅用于编写或执行代码、运行命令、修改项目文件；\n- 【search_task】：仅用于需要互联网实时信息、网页检索或网页正文的任务；\n- 【analysis_task】：仅用于读取本地文件、代码、数据库或项目结构并进行分析的任务；\n- 【direct_answer】：用于不需要专业工具或后续节点的普通问答，payload 必须是可直接返回用户的完整答案。\n\n可以同时选择多个专业端口，也可以只选择一个；但 direct_answer 不能和专业端口同时选择。不要向不需要的端口投递占位内容。每个专业端口的 payload 必须是下游专家可独立执行的明确指令。只使用已声明端口。",
      "tools": [],
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "user_query",
          "name": "用户输入"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "code_task",
          "description": "分配给代码专家的任务"
        },
        {
          "id": "search_task",
          "description": "分配给搜索专家的任务"
        },
        {
          "id": "analysis_task",
          "description": "分配给分析专家的任务"
        },
        {
          "id": "direct_answer",
          "description": "无需专业分支时直接返回用户的完整答案"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 350,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_coder",
      "type": "AGENT",
      "name": "代码执行专家",
      "model_name": "deepseek-chat",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "system_prompt": "你是一个强大的全栈程序员与系统运维专家。你可以使用工具执行 Python、JavaScript 或 Bash 脚本，也能安全地将代码写入本地文件。收到任务后，请自行编写代码并执行，验证无误后，将你的执行结果或总结输出。",
      "tools": [
        "execute_python_code",
        "execute_javascript_code",
        "execute_bash_script",
        "git_safe_modify"
      ],
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "code_task",
          "name": "代码任务"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "code_result",
          "description": "代码执行结果"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 750,
        "y": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_searcher",
      "type": "AGENT",
      "name": "全网搜索专家",
      "model_name": "deepseek-chat",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "system_prompt": "你是一个情报收集专家。当你收到搜索任务时，使用搜索工具在互联网上寻找最新的、准确的信息。如果有必要，可以抓取特定网页的正文。整理好情报后输出。",
      "tools": [
        "web_search",
        "get_content_from_url"
      ],
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "search_task",
          "name": "搜索任务"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "search_result",
          "description": "搜索结果摘要"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 750,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_analyzer",
      "type": "AGENT",
      "name": "数据与项目分析专家",
      "model_name": "deepseek-chat",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "system_prompt": "你是一个资深数据分析师和架构师。你可以读取本地文件、查阅数据库结构、执行 SQL 查询，或者扫描整个项目结构。收到任务后，仔细分析数据或代码结构，提炼出有价值的洞察并输出。",
      "tools": [
        "execute_sql_query",
        "get_database_schema",
        "read_local_file",
        "search_project",
        "list_files_in_directory",
        "get_project_structure",
        "search_code"
      ],
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "analysis_task",
          "name": "分析任务"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "analysis_result",
          "description": "分析报告"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 750,
        "y": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_summarizer",
      "type": "AGENT",
      "name": "全局总结与报告专家",
      "model_name": "deepseek-chat",
      "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
      "system_prompt": "你是最终答案汇总器。你可能收到代码、检索、分析三个端口中的一个或多个结果；缺失端口代表该分支未执行，不是错误。只依据实际收到的内容进行综合，消除重复与矛盾，突出结论、证据和必要的风险说明，使用清晰的 Markdown 输出。最终答案只投递到【final_summary】端口。",
      "tools": [],
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "code_result",
          "name": "代码结果"
        },
        {
          "id": "search_result",
          "name": "搜索结果"
        },
        {
          "id": "analysis_result",
          "name": "分析结果"
        }
      ],
      "output_ports": [
        {
          "id": "final_summary",
          "description": "最终总结回复"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 1200,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_node",
      "type": "END",
      "position": {
        "x": 1600,
        "y": 300
      },
      "input_ports": [
        {
          "id": "in_result"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "source_node": "start_node",
      "source_port": "out_query",
      "target_node": "node_dispatcher",
      "target_port": "user_query"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_dispatcher",
      "source_port": "code_task",
      "target_node": "node_coder",
      "target_port": "code_task"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_dispatcher",
      "source_port": "search_task",
      "target_node": "node_searcher",
      "target_port": "search_task"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_dispatcher",
      "source_port": "analysis_task",
      "target_node": "node_analyzer",
      "target_port": "analysis_task"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_dispatcher",
      "source_port": "direct_answer",
      "target_node": "end_node",
      "target_port": "in_result"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_coder",
      "source_port": "code_result",
      "target_node": "node_summarizer",
      "target_port": "code_result"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_searcher",
      "source_port": "search_result",
      "target_node": "node_summarizer",
      "target_port": "search_result"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_analyzer",
      "source_port": "analysis_result",
      "target_node": "node_summarizer",
      "target_port": "analysis_result"
    },
    {
      "source_node": "node_summarizer",
      "source_port": "final_summary",
      "target_node": "end_node",
      "target_port": "in_result"
    }
  ]
}
